          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuhandiichile malaika weikanisa eyili eEfeso, ori",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka aboola, oyo outiila tsinyininyini etsio musaafu mumukhonokwe musaatsa, oyo ouchenda hakari webichibi musaafu bieitsahaabu bietsitaha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu Emanyile ebikholebio, mbu okhunyakhanakhwo nende okhwifwilakhwo; khandi shinga abandu ababii olwa bakhusinyila elala; khandi shinga olwa wateema abo abeelanga mbu abanabii nibarali bario ta, nonyoolelesia obukaatii bwabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oli nobwisimilisii; weefwila khulwanje, noratofuhala tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa endi nelikhuwa lino khwiwe, mbu walekha obuheelibwo obwambeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho witsulile aha warula niwaakukha, niwikalukhasia, nokhola shinga olwa wakholanga olwambeli; nebutswa noba noreekalukhasia ta, ndakheetse nirusia eshichibi shieitahayo habundu washio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habula lino oli ninalio, mbu okiyanga ebiima biabaNikolai, ebia siesi engiyanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ouli namarwi, ahuliie aka Roho asunjila tsikanisa. Oyo ouhula, ndalamufuchiilila okhulia khumusaala kwobulamu, okuliho mumukunda kwaNyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akaboolelwa ikanisa yeSimuririna",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohandiichile malaika weikanisa eyili eSimurina, ori",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka aboola, oyo ouli owambeli, nowokhuhelelesia, owali omufu mana naba mwoyo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu Emanyile amasila aka oli ninako, nende obumananibwo, khane noli omuyinda, nende obunyechi bwa abo ababoola mbu nabaYahudi nibarali bario ta, habula nabeisinagogi yaSetani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oraria aka oli ahambi okhusaalisilibwa ta; lole, Setani ali okhusukuna abandi khwinywe mumbohe, mbu muteemwe; mulaba mumasila tsindaalo ekhumi. Obeetsenje omwisiikwa okhuula khukhufwa, kho ndalakhuheelesia olusimbi Iwobulamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ouli namarwi, ahulile aka Roho asunjila tsikanisa. Oyo ouhula, okhufwa khwokhubili okhwo khubula likhuwa khuye ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akaboolelwa ikanisa yePerigamo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohandiichile malaika weikanisa eyili ePerigamo, ori",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka aboola, oyo ouli nolukanga olumemu, olwamema tsimbeka tsiombi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu Emanyile aha omenyanga, mbu aha eshifumbi; shioburuchi shiaSetani shili. Ne ohandanga khuliira lianje. Shiwaambakhana akasuubilwa khwisie ta, kata mundaalo tsiaAndipa omuloli wanje, omwisiikwa wanje, oweerelwa hakari weenywe, aha Setani amenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa endikhwo namakhuwa amatuutu khwiwe; shichila ebweneyo oli nende abandi abahanda khumeebaalo kaBalaamu, oyo oweebaalila Balaki okhura eshiisichirasio imbeli wabaana baIsiraeli, mwikhuwa liokhulia ebindu biemisango echimaliilwe ebifwanani, nende obuheyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi oli nende abandi nabo abahanda bario khumeebaalo kabaNikolai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho wikalukhasie; nebutswa nekhwitsile bwangu nimbaseera lihe nende olukanga Iwomunwa kwanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ouli namarwi, ahulile aka Roho asunjila tsikanisa. Oyo ouhula, ndalamuheelesiakhwo khumana eyo eyamabiswi; khandi ndalamuheelesia lichina lilafu, ne khwichina elo lilabakhwo eliira liyia nilihandiichilwe, elia oundi yesi aramanyakhwo ta, habula oyo ouliheebwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akaboolelwa ikanisa yaTsiatira",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ohandiichile malaika weikanisa eyili eTsiatira, ori",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko aka ahoola, Omwana waNyasaye, owa tsimonitsie tsiingana olumemu Iwomulilo, ebilenjebie nabio nibiingana emikasa echiaruutwa niching'inang'ina; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu Emanyile ebikholebio, nobuheelibwo, nobusuubili nobukhalabani nobwisimilisii; khandi shinga ebikholebio ebihelelesia olwa bishila ebiambeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne endi nelikhuwa lino khwiwe, mbu ofuchiililanga omukhasi oyo Yezebeli, owilanga mbu omunabii; naye yeechesinjia abasumba banje nabashiamia mbu bakhole akobuheyi nibalia ebindu biemisango echiamaliilwe ebifwanani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndamuheelesia obwiyangu okhwikalukhasia; ne shiachama okhwikalukhasia okhulekha obuheyibwe ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, emusukuna khubulili bwobusaalili; nabo aba aheyanga ninabo, embasukuna mumasila amakali, habula nibeekalukhasia okhulekha ebikholebie; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khandi abaanabe ndalabeera bwira. Natsio tsikanisa tsiosi tsilamanya mbu isie nisie ourunilisinjia akemioyo nende amayililisio; ne ndalamurunga, ebikhole biabuli mundu shinga olwa bili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano emusunjila inywe abandi abasikala khubaTsiatira, abaralikhwo abameebaalo ako ta, abaramanya amakhuwa aka balanga mbu amakhuwa kaSetani akali musi bwene, ta; ndi Shimumeetela omusiiko kundi kwosi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
